async function prepareReports(){if(!global.SyncEngine||!global.COL)return;const defs={okulBilgileri:COL.okulBilgileri,resmiTatiller:COL.resmiTatiller},types=[];for(const[t,c]of Object.entries(defs)){if(c){SyncEngine.register(t,c);types.push(t)}}if(types.length){await SyncEngine.localHydrate(types);SyncEngine.schedule(60)}}
